try?.value.toFixed(0) || '--' }}</strong><span>{{ store.dashboard.telemetry?.unit }}</span><small>FAN-01 · 风机转速</small></div><div class="chart-bars"><i v-for="(height, index) in bars" :key="index" :style="{ height: `${height}%` }" :class="{ current: index > 20 }" /></div><div class="chart-meta"><span>历史模拟</span><b>可信质量：良好</b><span>当前</span></div></article></section><section class="dashboard-grid lower-grid"><article class="panel activity-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACTIVITY STREAM</span><h2>最新运行动态</h2></div><RouterLink to="/audit">审计追踪 →</RouterLink></div><div class="activity-item" v-for="item in store.audit.slice(0, 4)" :key="item.id"><i /><time>{{ new Date(item.occurredAt).toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }) }}</time><div><b>{{ item.action }}</b><p>{{ JSON.stringify(item.detail) }}</p></div></div><div v-if="!store.audit.length" class="empty-state">登录 Django API 后，这里会显示实时审计流。</div></article><article class="readiness-panel"><span class="eyebrow">SYSTEM READINESS</span><h2>交付就绪度</h2><strong>94<small>/ 100</small></strong><div class="progress"><i /></div><p>告警、工单、资产、审计及角色控制已由统一数据模型联动。</p><RouterLink to="/settings">查看系统配置 →</RouterLink></article></section></AppShell></template>
